ing the selected candidate, applicability assessments, and diagnostics about why candidates were rejected.\n\nThe type inference and overload resolution chain flows as follows: When a method group is encountered, MethodTypeInferrer.Infer is applied to each generic method to infer type arguments. Then OverloadResolution orchestrates the selection by comparing candidates using BetterFunctionMember, with the Conversions class ranking conversion costs to determine the best match. Finally, BestTypeInferrer handles special cases for array and conditional expression type inference."
